  "solution": "a) Cấp số cộng với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math> công sai <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Số hạng thứ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Số hạng tổng quát <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br>Số hạng thứ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>100</mn></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>100</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>99</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>499</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\tb) Cấp số cộng với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> công sai <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</m